{"ID":"20240522082305-8w16ukl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082305-8w16ukl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082305-8w16ukl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084851-dgx8l3k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084944-jrybax5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1747,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084944-jrybax5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"外傷的急救案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522084944"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-dgx8l3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-dgx8l3k","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人紀外科事件簿 : 菜刀砍傷"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-37g26lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-37g26lc","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發生日期 : 2008.06.07 星期六早上快九點時"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-5re6xjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-5re6xjy","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發生地點 : 嘈雜的傳統菜市場"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-i339w0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-i339w0n","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"受害人 : 70歲的婦人"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-5v536lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-5v536lv","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"事由 :     婦人菜市場買菜, 跟菜市場小販借砍竹筍的菜刀, 然後一個準頭拿揑不穩, 就砍到自己的手指了, 當場血流如注, 因為傷口較深, 所以血流量不小. 砍到左手大姆頭上的較大的血管了. 傷口約1.5公分寬, 縱深約0.5公分寬, 斜切面約切入1公分深."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-5pzpyd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-5pzpyd1","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處理流程 :"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-u884lz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-u884lz5","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          2008.06.07"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-aqxdskx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-aqxdskx","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-hre5o2m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-hre5o2m","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-0v4qlg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-0v4qlg7","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"見到病患時, 是早上九點多, 由於血流量仍大. 且不止. 因病患怕針, 用按止血點的方法, 還是不太有效 馬上調配中藥生粉. 直接大量灑在傷口上."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-nczvv09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-nczvv09","updated":"20240522084902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"消炎六寶藥方: 【大黃, 黃柏, 黃芩, 黃連, 連翹, 金銀花】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-812k0cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-812k0cq","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思考: 四黃可消炎消毒, 連翹可消炎排膿, 金銀花可幫忙消炎消毒"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-fo3prmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-fo3prmn","updated":"20240522084919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"成效 : 藥粉灑到傷口時, 血流已開始變慢. 距受傷約半個小時後, 血流現象即完全停止, 且撕裂般的疼痛感也漸漸不見了."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-ezrpgfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-ezrpgfj","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早上每隔一小時就灑藥一次. 中午之後, 每8個小時換藥一次, 且嚴禁碰水, 睡覺時, 傷口外以通風透氣防水之貼布包住."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-9j0w2ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-9j0w2ze","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.08"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-w1mjct2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-w1mjct2","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每8小時換藥一次. 嚴禁碰水. 傷口幾乎已不覺疼痛. 除非去碰到."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-gjj1cd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-gjj1cd1","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.09"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-041et23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-041et23","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發現傷口復原情況OK, 但有一個小點會把藥粉衝開, 且不斷流湯出來, 心知此點為較深之傷口."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-00zabif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-00zabif","updated":"20240522084906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"消炎六寶藥方再加二味生粉 : 【白朮, 茯苓】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-ot7bqwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-ot7bqwf","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思考: 人紀所教. 白朮, 茯苓可收濕. 若加入此二味傷口若不能收濕, 為免日後形成膿包, 會考慮再加入赤小豆, 協助連翹做排膿."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-kotet8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-kotet8d","updated":"20240522084921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"成效: 約半天之後, 傷口湯汁即已收乾. 所以不需要派赤小豆出場"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-jabm4y4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-jabm4y4","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.09"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-fflxz37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-fflxz37","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"換藥變成早晚各一次."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-qc137le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-qc137le","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.10"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-wxubdtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-wxubdtt","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到了第四天, 就算碰到傷口也沒有痛感. 但傷口外表開始有瘀青的狀況. 所以手指仍然無法用力. 太用力會痛."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-atsn9q7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-atsn9q7","updated":"20240522084913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"消炎去濕藥方再加二味生粉 : 【茜草, 桃仁】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-njt74ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-njt74ri","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思考 : 這二味都是可以活血化瘀的藥, 雖然傷口不在肝經上, 但剛好家裏有茜草生粉, 心想直接用外敷的, 茜草應還是能助桃仁去瘀活血."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-4em9kk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-4em9kk7","updated":"20240522084923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"成效: 一天後, 瘀血開始變淡."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-owicakb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-owicakb","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.11"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-2w4lr3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-2w4lr3p","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"傷口開始出現結痂狀況."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-qhe8u3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-qhe8u3m","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.13"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-z10y011","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-z10y011","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到了第七天, 手指就算用到力, 也不會痛了. 結痂的形狀很漂亮."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-c3croqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-c3croqz","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l            2008.06.21"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-gfdcuts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-gfdcuts","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   原來的傷口, 痂已掉, 並長出很漂亮的肉和皮. 治療結束,"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-r6tojza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-r6tojza","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"結論 :"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-d7zswdl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-d7zswdl","updated":"20240522084931"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-93uh6db","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-93uh6db","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-94fb2q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-94fb2q8","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若是沒學人紀, 此種傷口, 應是會送西醫外科去縫合. 但痊癒日期應該沒這麼快. 依照以前弟子自己的親身經驗, 傷口較深的, 至少要一個月以上才會開始結痂. 婦人要多受很多天的苦. 中藥的威力真的很強. 師父教的人紀真的很棒."}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-bghu89v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-bghu89v","updated":"20240522084931"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-yh40lrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-yh40lrt","updated":"20240522084931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師父人紀所教, 傷口用生粉處理, 傷口會癒合的很好. 因為粉狀物有空隙, 可以讓皮膚呼吸的到空氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":". 這次的事件, 得到完整的證實. 先假設師父所教為對, 再進一步去實作與求證. 是學人紀的不二法門."}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-6mlxm8b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-6mlxm8b","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-5hrzdnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-5hrzdnd","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原先考慮, 若是傷口癒合不好, 也許再考慮加入玉竹, 玉竹可幫忙長肌肉.而若不小心傷到骨, 也可以加入續斷, 傷到筋的話, 就加入秦艽.調一個人紀出品的黑玉斷續膏. 但這二個沙盤推演都沒用到. 婦人的傷口就好了."}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-t0smf1k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-t0smf1k","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-flqipgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-flqipgb","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後來還想到, 若病患怕針, 當血流較大時, 也許還有一味藥可以用看看, 那就是白芍, 因為白芍主收斂. 也許有助於停止血流如注的情況發生. 另還有朋友後來教授用蒲黃生粉也可止住血流不止的現象."}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-002p5ax","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-002p5ax","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-oga5jpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-oga5jpn","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2007年夏天, 有朋友騎摩拖車出車禍. 整個人摔車出去, 四肢多處皮肉傷,"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-gzvl52g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-gzvl52g","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有些地方, 皮都不見了. 多位一起學習人紀的朋友先幫忙下針, 調五臟氣亂以及多處子穴幫忙止痛. 弟子則先幫忙調中藥生粉. 以四黃為基底, 再加白朮, 茯苓. 然後把調好的粉, 都灑在受傷同事所有的受傷部位, 很快的. 睡了一個晚上, 朋友的傷口都結痂了. 癒合速度之快, 讓我們這些當時初學人紀之犢, 不由得由心裏發出喝采. 師父教的中醫真是太棒了."}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-z3p5shf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-z3p5shf","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-luydll1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-luydll1","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084851-p7za44r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-p7za44r","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此次婦人的案例, 傷口較去年朋友受傷的深度多很多, 血流也大很多.但一樣可以迅速恢復. 我們讀到的人紀是一部無價的寶. 能把人救回來, 自己心裏是非常感激恩師的辛苦傳承的. 弟子衷心感謝恩師的無私教授."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-gckf4a9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-gckf4a9","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"弟子 楊小邪 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-tisayha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-tisayha","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-nfj0uq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-nfj0uq6","updated":"20240522084934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 這是一位目前就讀於廣州中醫藥大學碩士班的人紀班學員，同學們看到這個案例就可以了解到，他們這一群學生，雖然還在繼續進修中醫學中，但是因為學到人紀後，馬上就可以實際在臨床上幫助到病人，遠比他們在學校中所教的臨床要強許多，醫學上不需要區分中西醫學或是溫病派醫學等，只要對病人有助益的就是好醫學，現在所有醫案都可以證明西醫學與溫病派中醫是無法治病的醫學，只有經方家才是真正的醫學家，希望你們以後取得碩士學位畢業後，能替黎民百姓解決更多的病痛，做一位真正的醫學家。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084851-iljljqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084851-iljljqh","updated":"20240522084851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於台北07/21/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522084943-3f411k4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522084943-3f411k4"}},{"ID":"20240522084944-jrybax5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084944-jrybax5"}}]}